v6.51.x WOF SysOps Read This!
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    If you're presently using v6.51, or one of it's update versions "a" thru
"d", you can do the update to 6.52 manually by simply copying the NEWER ARexx 
Command Files from this archive in place of the one's you are currently using. 
You DO NOT have to reset the game, nor will you have to replace any of the
files located in the "Texts/" directory other than the "WOF_News" file, which
has the updated version number in it's ANSI screen.

    Make sure to also copy over the contents of the Guides/ subdirectory, the
SysOpReg and UserReg files in the Incentive/ subdirectory, in addition to
those files located in the main WoFortune/ directory.

Happy Gaming!

